<title>USA: USDA releases $50 mln in GSM-102 credits to Egypt.</title>
<headline>USDA releases $50 mln in GSM-102 credits to Egypt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Wednesday said it released $50 million in export credit guarantees for sales of U.S. farmgoods to Egypt under the GSM-102 program for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said with the move, the total $200 million in program coverage authorized for sales to Egypt has been allocated.</p>
</text>
